    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000209",
    "title": "The Practice of the Presence of God",
    "description": "A modern-English adaptation of the public-domain text of The Practice of the Presence of God, retaining its original conversations and letters.",
    "total_days": 19,
    "tags": [
